formation  stored in dentate in CA 3 what is the  nature of that comparison and really  what is it doing toward the circuitry so  finally let me just acknowledge all the  wonderful collaborators I've had joy  about sue just is now an assistant  professor at NYU  Stephanie Chung is  going to medical school bread Hitty is a  neurosurgeon at Penn  Felix Laroy and David Brown are both in  the lab now Josh dun Minh started this  all a number of years ago with David  side and we were grateful we had  wonderful collaboration on the imaging  with attila and jeff Zaremba boris  Immelman gave us an advice and help with  the viruses and some others I thank you  for your attention and for staying awake  for the whole day
 

